                    -- went through _forceInvisToggle twice, which re-guesses
                    -- on/off from leftover state (oldRoot / an orphan root in
                    -- the camera): the second call could read "still on" and
                    -- turn invis OFF again instead of back on, so recovery left
                    -- you visible -- or, with an orphan left behind, respawned.
