        -- Held a few seconds past the hand-off, not dropped instantly: the cycle
        -- needs a moment to raise __Skyr0CicloRodando, and a prewarm slipping
        -- into that gap is exactly the collision this is here to prevent.
        task.delay(4, soltar)
